{
 "title": "Managing Invoices in Guided Buying",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Managing Invoices in Guided Buying</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"You can approve, make changes, or resolve errors on invoices in guided buying. To view invoice reconciliation details, you must navigate to SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"You can approve, make changes, or resolve errors on invoices in guided buying. To view invoice reconciliation details, you must navigate to SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page concept  - topic-topic concept-concept \" id=\"loioc77ddb1b1024402398baaeed020bedef\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Managing Invoices in Guided Buying</h1><p class=\"shortdesc\">You can approve, make changes, or resolve errors on invoices in guided buying. To view\ninvoice reconciliation details, you must navigate to <span class=\"ph\" translate=\"no\">SAP Ariba Buying and\nInvoicing</span>.</p><div class=\"related-links\"> <br><ul class=\"ullinks\"><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"875c2baef19b4e97bdfc886eb73e4374.html\" title=\"You can view, edit, and approve non-PO and PO invoices in Your Approvals. From there you can edit and approve invoices.\">Approving Invoices in Guided Buying</a></strong><br></div><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"c447ba7eab9e4935b6e150eaeedfe421.html\" title=\"You might want to edit invoices to change quantities, add taxes, or edit discounts. Once the changes are approved, the invoice can be reconciled and the supplier can be paid.\">Changing Invoices in Guided Buying</a></strong><br></div><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"b764c51cce8a4245880cf9f062e2e337.html\" title=\"When viewing an invoice in guided buying, you can click a link to check the progress and details of reconciliation in SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing.\">Checking Invoice Reconciliation Details in SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing</a></strong><br></div><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"0d2362cc563e4bf98928d40536c72206.html\" title=\"You can view, edit, and approve non-PO and PO invoices in Your Approvals. When an invoice contains errors, you can resolve the errors in guided buying, and then approve the invoice. Errors on invoices in guided buying are triggered by policies in guided buying, standard validations, or by custom validations in SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing.\">Resolving Errors on Invoices in Guided Buying</a></strong><br></div></ul></div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
}